{%- comment -%}
  oma-bloggle-skin — loads assets/oma-bloggle-article.css, which brand-skins
  the Bloggle app's article template (fonts, colors, spacing on its fixed
  IDs/classes). Renders no markup of its own.

  main-bloggle-article.liquid is Bloggle-app-owned (ownership map: "no"),
  so it can't be edited directly — this is the only lever available for
  bringing the live article template (templateSuffix: bloggle-custom, used
  by every published article as of Oct 2026) in line with the rest of the
  site's NHD/brand-color system. The stylesheet's selectors are doubled up
  for specificity, so this section's position in the template's section
  order doesn't matter — add it anywhere on article.bloggle-custom.json.
{%- endcomment -%}
{{ 'oma-bloggle-article.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "OMA Bloggle Skin",
  "tag": "section",
  "disabled_on": {
    "groups": ["header", "footer"]
  },
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    { "name": "OMA Bloggle Skin" }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
